00:04:46.064 --> 00:04:52.303
<v Host>Long lines formed at the zoo every day to see the first two pandas, a gift from China.

00:04:52.903 --> 00:04:55.327
<v Vocab>行列

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:59.208
<v Host>It means a long line, or queue, of people.

00:04:59.807 --> 00:05:08.903
<v Slow>それから50年余り、パンダはずっと動物園で一番の人気者でした。

00:05:09.704 --> 00:05:15.127
<v Host>For more than fifty years since then, pandas have been the biggest stars of the zoo.

00:05:15.728 --> 00:05:18.199
<v Vocab>人気者

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:22.487
<v Host>It means a popular favorite — someone everyone loves.

00:05:23.088 --> 00:05:34.439
<v Slow>パンダたちは、2020年に、西園にできた新しい施設「パンダのもり」に引っ越しました。

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:41.336
<v Host>In 2020, the pandas moved to a new facility built in the zoo's west garden.

